":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/15421","diff_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/15421.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/15421.patch","merged_at":"2022-03-15T15:23:56Z"},"body":"Ticket : [#31169](https://code.djangoproject.com/ticket/31169)\r\nPrevious PR : #12646\r\n\r\nThis is my attempt at rebasing the previous PR and to accomodate the comments. There was a lot of discussion on the previous PR so maybe I've not captured everything as yet, likley I've also not interpreted it all correctly as well. \r\n\r\nI've had to make a some small changes so that this passess locally for me on both Windows and Linux but interested to see what the test suites here have to say. I've also changed `get_max_test_processes()` so the test suite will now run in parallel by default when `spawn` is in play. \r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/15421/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/15421/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/12646","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/12646/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/12646/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/12646/events","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/12646","id":591138949,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0Mzk2MzYwMjkz","number":12646,"title":"Fixed #31169 -- Adapted the parallel test runner to use spawn. [GSoC]","user":{"login":"lothemar","id":17365134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzY1MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17365134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lothemar","html_url":"https://github.com/lothemar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lothemar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lothemar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lothemar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lothemar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lothemar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lothemar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lothemar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lothemar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lothemar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":37,"created_at":"2020-03-31T14:06:02Z","updated_at":"2022-02-23T10:37:23Z","closed_at":"2022-02-14T05:15:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/12646","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/12646","diff_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/12646.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/12646.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"ticket-31169\r\n\r\n# TO DO:\r\n- ~Ensure test runner works with ```--reverse```~ Fixed (not sure how)\r\n- PostgreSQL:\r\n   - ~Investigate inspectdb failure~ [Patch submitted to fix](https://code.djangoproject.com/ticket/31736)\r\n   - ~Fix m2m_through failure (fails on Windows with ```--parallel=1``` as well)~ Fixed\r\n- ~Add parallel support for Oracle, whether spawned or forked~ [PR](https://github.com/django/django/pull/13326)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/12646/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/1264